2 CONT
2 CONT Handelsrikene 1300-1400
2 CONT
2 CONT 1305
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Sigurd Eldjarn on Sundbu marries Guttorm Tjøstolvson on Hundorp son of Tjøstolv Dictate Ombudsman for Governor Guttorm Eriksson. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1331
2 CONT
2 CONT November 16th was the sheriffs Guttorm Tjøstolvsson on Hundorp and Eystein Raggad and five other men, on Reistad Gausdal to mediate a case between Birger and Bjorn Rud. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1345
2 CONT
2 CONT Guttorm Tjøstolvson sell the farm Rindal Oyer nephew Elf Håkonsson May 19. Son Paul Gutormsson, his only son agree to the sale. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1349
2 CONT
2 CONT In October, when the plague Vaga. It is the bacterium Yersinia pestis causes it. The plague is basically a rat disease. Tens of thousands of micro-organisms swimming around in rat blood and multiply explosively. Those are just a f
2 CONC ew thousandths of a millimeter long, and quickly paralyzes the lungs and heart. There are flea Xenopsylla cheopis spreading bacteria. Fleas live in the shaggy rat fur and feeds primarily on rat blood. Up to twice a day lay eggs in
2 CONC  rat fur. In month-end December dies Guttorm Tjøstolvson and ten of his closest relatives in the plague. Among them were his wife, one of her brother's sons and his wife, son Eric, daughter and the man who had recently married, tw
2 CONC o sons, brother and brother's daughter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Those who were left were four old, 4 adults and 7 babies. 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT * Black Death https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Death_in_Norway
