1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Engebret Hougen gir i si Ættesoge for Gudbrandsdalen en nokså omfattende utredelse, hvor han hevder at Synne Iversdatter Sandbu var gift med Amund Iversen Røssum, og at det ikke har eksistert noen Amund Tjøstelsen 
2 CONC Harilstad, men at han hette Amund Iversen. Gammel ættetradisjon og alle ætteoppegnelser på Harilstad tilsier at Synne Iversdatter Sandbu var gift med Asmund Tjøstelsen Harilstad. Ola O. Røssum mener også å ha fullgode bevis på at 
2 CONC Synne Iversdatter Sandbu var gift med Asmund Tjøstelsen Harilstad.
2 CONT
2 CONT Engebret Hougen provides in its Descendancy for Gudbrandsdalen, a fairly extensive accomplishment, in which he argues that Synne Iversdtr. Sandbu was married to Amund Iversen Røssum, and that there existed an Amund Tjøstelsen Hari
2 CONC lstad, but he was named Amund Iversen. Old family traditions, and all on ætteoppegnelser Harilstad, suggest that Synne Iversdtr. Sandbu was married to Asmund Tjøstelsen Harilstad. Ola O. Røssum also believes to have adequate evide
2 CONC nce that Synne Iversdtr. Sandbu was married to Asmund Tjøstelsen Harilstad.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT from Engebret Hougen's:  Aettesoge for Gudbrandsdalen, p. 110 & ff.
2 CONT --------------------
