2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Rane Jonsen Rani, to Gørslev and Kristina Alvsdatter to Thornberg  Husband of NN Petersdatter Halland  Father of Niculas Eivindsson Søum; Rane Eyvindsson and Lodin (Lodvik) Evindsson  Brother to Johannes Rani; Ranesdatter; 
2 CONC Nikolas (Niels) Ranesson; Orm Raneson and Torstein Ranesson  Half brother of Peter Jakobsson (Jack) Halland and NN Jakobsdtr Leopard of Halland  Occupation: at Sodheim in Komnes f.ca in 1280 married probably to the daughter of kni
2 CONC ght Peter Jakobsson of Halland (of the mighty descendants of Skjalm Hvites and King Waldemar Siers) in Denmark, he received the son of Reine in Comnes socket in Sandsvær in about 1336	
