2 CONT sogneprest (Pastor) Claus Jørgensen
2 CONT
2 CONT Adeluts Hansdtr Teiste Hananger was born at Teiste, Lista, Vest Agder, Norway. She married sogneprest Laurits Lauritsen Bjerkreim, son of Laurits Lauritsen Fuglestad and (--?--) Torgersdtr Slettebø. She married sogneprest Claus Jø
2 CONC rgensen, son of sogneprest Jørgen Clausen Mylting, circa 1642. She died in 1651 at Bjerkreim, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, Norway. She is mentioned .Lund 110. Lista II.435, Bjerkreim I.135.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT His father was parish priest at Oddernes from 1610 until 1642. Claus took 'studenteksamen' in 1632. It thus seems likely that he was born between about 1612 and 1616, at Oddernes, Kristiansand, rather than in Denmark. Is there any
2 CONC  evidence that he died 11-08-1670?
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/c716d7017a66e446ae126feb3d599c92?page=149&searchText=claussen Kåre Rudjord, 1965, "Oddernes bygdebok:bygdehistorie" (Kirke og prest, Jørgen Claussen, p. 146)]
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/dbf0ba35373139a67e5143c4246a44e8?page=48 Olav Heskestad, 1962, "Kyrkjeliv i Lund: utgjve til 150 års jubileet av Lund kyrkje 1962" (Prester i Lundskallet, Claus Jørgensen, pp. 47-48)]
2 CONT ----
