1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Elin Bentsdotter Hård (c. 1535 – after 1596)'''==
2 CONT
2 CONT Elin Bentsdotter Hård was a member of the influential Hård family and a descendant of the prominent '''Dyre Sevaldsson''' lineage (Lunner-ætten). Her life connects the administrative elite of Oppland with the clerical circles of V
2 CONC estfold.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parentage and Heritage'''
2 CONT * '''Father''': '''Bent Andersson (Hård)''', the Lagmann (lawspeaker) of Oppland.
2 CONT * '''Mother''': '''Karen (Kari) Dyresdotter''', daughter of '''Dyre Sevaldsson''' of Hanestad.
2 CONT Through her mother, Elin was a co-heir to significant estate shares, including '''Kirke-Hole''' in Ringerike, Hanestad, and Sørum.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marriage and Life in Våle'''
2 CONT Elin married '''Rasmus Søvrensson Frendesonius''' (d. 1599), the parish priest (''sogneprest'') of Våle in Vestfold. As the wife of a prominent clergyman and the daughter of a high-ranking legal official, Elin held a high social s
2 CONC tatus. Her husband represented her interests in legal disputes over the Dyre Sevaldsson inheritance, most notably in a court case before the Oslo-lagmann Niels Stub in 1572.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/people/Beritte-Nordre-Sørby/6000000017651592713?through=6000000005911814275 Beritte] (Birgitte): Married lensmann '''Vemund Sørby'''. This connection explains the transfer of large landholdings in Ringerike
2 CONC  (Sætrang) and Land (Setton) from Elin’s ancestors to the Sørby family in Våle.
2 CONT # '''Søren Rasmussen Frendesonius''' (c. 1570 – 1645): He followed in his father's footsteps in the clergy, serving as a palace chaplain at Akershus (slottsprest) before becoming the parish priest in Lom.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources''':
2 CONT * '''Christiansen, Per Reidar Bjørnerud''': "Dyre Sevaldssons Ætt", NST 35/4 (1996). P. 387-435.
2 CONT * '''Gustavsen, Are S.''': "Var lensmannsenken Beritte på Sørby i Våle en etterkommer av Dyre Sevaldsson?" NST 39/3 (2004).
2 CONT * '''Vigerust, Tore H.''': "Dyre Sevaldssons ætt eller Lunner-ætten", Slekt og data 1995, No. 3. [https://admin.slektogdata.no/sites/default/files/2019-08/1995-3.pdf P. 19].
2 CONT ————————————-
2 CONT
