2 CONT
2 CONT Kommentér og diskutér
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT The earliest known member of the Losna-family was Erlend Filippusson at Losna who died in 1407. The theory that he's a son of Filippus Erlendsson at Osland is highly dubious. This Filippus had a daughter who married in the 1330's,
2 CONC  and the chronology doesn't  fit to place Erlend Filippusson at Losna as her brother.
2 CONT
2 CONT As for the descent of Filippus Erlendsson through Erlend Arnesson, that is based purely on guesswork - containing too much fiction and a minimal amout of facts.
2 CONT
2 CONT  The known persons of Losna-family is limited to six - 6 - persons. Three men and three women, and the only living persons that can claim descent of this family has to descend from Sigrid Erlendsdotter (died 1528) and her husband,
2 CONC  the Danish nobleman Bo Flemming (died est.
2 CONT
2 CONT  1491/1492). Their daughter married into the Danish noble family Rosenkrantz.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Tree:
2 CONT
2 CONT  Erlend Filippusson at Losna
2 CONT
2 CONT  m[entioned] 1366-d.1407
2 CONT
2 CONT  Two children:
2 CONT
2 CONT  Sigrid Erlendsdotter m.1391-1425
2 CONT
2 CONT  married 1. Håkon Sigurdsson Roos at Giske (d.1407)
2 CONT
2 CONT  married 2. Magnus Magnusson at Giske
2 CONT
2 CONT  Eindride Erlendsson at Losna
2 CONT
2 CONT  m.1384-1442
2 CONT
2 CONT  He had one known child
2 CONT
2 CONT  Erlend Eindridesson at Losna, m.1429-died est.1452
2 CONT
