1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ===REVEREND MR. ROBERT MOWAT===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Minister of the Gospel at Mid Yell, afterwards at Fetlar and North Yell===
2 CONT
2 CONT The Reverend Mr. Robert Mowat is the son of the Reverend Mr. Gilbert Mowat of Garth.[https://archive.org/stream/fastiecclesiaesc07scot#page/302/mode/1up Fasti Ecclesiae Scoticanae] He was minister of the Gospel at Mid Yell from ab
2 CONC out 1655 until about 1684 [https://archive.org/stream/fastiecclesiaesc07scot#page/295/mode/1up Fasti Ecclesiae Scoticanae] and minister of the Gospel at Fetlar and North Yell from about 1684 unril his death. He died unmarried befo
2 CONC re 1694. [https://archive.org/stream/fastiecclesiaesc07scot#page/302/mode/1up Fasti Ecclesiae Scoticanae]
