2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT
2 CONT <p>Klaus Henriksson Miltzow-- futen paa Mosafinn --</p>Klaus budde paa Mosafinn, som han vart eigar av kring 1665, og var ein megtig mann. Han arva
2 CONT mykje av jordgodset etter faren, var elles fut og ei tid forvaltar av krungodset paa Voss. Han
2 CONT døydde i 1692. Kona døydde aar 1700. Tvo av døtterene deira vart gifte med bondegutar paa Voss, og etter dei hev me ei vidgreint ætt i bygdi. Ho hev vorte nemnd 'Fute-slektæ' 23 JAN 2014 20:54:45  15 JAN 2012 19:50:26 
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT
2 CONT <p>Moved to Mosafinn on October 10, 1700</p>    Klaus lived at Mosafinn, of which he was the owner since about 1655, and he was a powerful man.  He inherited a great deal of real estate from his father; he was the bailiff and in a
2 CONC ddition was 'protector' of the Crown properties at Voss.  Two of their daughters married farm boys from Voss and after them we have a wide-spread linage in the district.It was called the 'bailiff lineage'.
2 CONT 23 JAN 2014 20:54:45  15 JAN 2012 19:50:26 
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT
2 CONT <p>Moved to Mosafinn on October 10, 1700</p>    Klaus lived at Mosafinn, of which he was the owner since about 1655, and he was a powerful man.  He inherited a great deal of real estate from his father; he was the bailiff and in a
2 CONC ddition was 'protector' of the Crown properties at Voss.  Two of their daughters married farm boys from Voss and after them we have a wide-spread linage in the district.It was called the 'bailiff lineage'.
2 CONT 23 JAN 2014 20:54:45  15 JAN 2012 19:50:26 
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT
2 CONT Mosefinn
