1 NAME Gerdt Henrikson /Miltzow/
2 GIVN Gerdt Henrikson
2 _MARNM Miltzow
2 NICK Gjert Henriksen Miltzow
1 NAME Gerdt Henrikson /Miltzow/
2 GIVN Gerdt Henrikson
2 SURN Miltzow
2 NICK Gjert Henriksen Miltzow
1 SEX M
1 OCCU Sogneprest
2 PLAC Voss, Hordaland
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 16 FEB 1629
2 ADDR
3 CITY Voss
3 STAE Hordaland
3 CTRY Norway
1 BURI
2 DATE 1688
2 ADDR
3 CITY Voss
