1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "He got a small piece of land while his father was still alive, and later took over the whole farm in 1667. Like his father he owned around a third of Indre Håland. In 1686 he is mentioned for having to meet in cou
2 CONC rt after cursing at Lars Vad, but he did not appear. He was in such a bad shape that he had to walk with a two handed staff according to a witness."
2 CONT
