1 OCCU Sogneprest i Haderslev Købstad
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [https://www.nb.no/items/8762a720ae8507442460dd29695a66d6 A. St. Castberg: Slekten Stabel-Stabell ca. 1200 til 1950 (Oslo 1955) side 10]<br/>
2 CONT "Lauritz Stabel må sikkert være sønn av Bastian Stapel i Hederslev og antas født ca. 1540. Om ham vites kun at han var far av [https://www.geni.com/people/Eline-Lauritsdatter-Stabel/6000000007521074619?through=6000000006852312489 
2 CONC Eline Lauritzdatter Stabel], f. ca. 1757 og var gift med herr Bård Nielsen (1572-1635), som var sogneprest i Biri og med hvem hun hadde 13 barn"<br/>
2 CONT (A. St. Castberg: The genus Stabel-Stabell ca. 1200 to 1950 (Oslo 1955) page 10
2 CONT '''''"Lauritz Stabel must surely be the son of Bastian Stapel in Hederslev and is believed to have been born circa 1540. About him it is only known that he was the father of Eline Lauritzdatter Stabel, b. ca. 1757 and was married 
2 CONC to Mr. Bård Nielsen (1572-1635), who was vicar of Biri and with whom she had 13 children")'''''''''''''''''
2 CONT
2 CONT Forøvrig angir B.O.Stuve i [https://www.nb.no/items/URN:NBN:no-nb_digibok_2007032701056 Hedmark Slektshistorielags Jubileumsskrift 1964] side 97 at det ikke foreligger noen positive holdepunkter for hvem Eline Lauritzdtr. kan ha v
2 CONC ært '''''(In addition, B.O.Stuve in hedmark Slektshistorielags Jubileumsskrift 1964 page 97 indicates that there is no positive evidence for whom Eline Lauritzdtr. may have been)'''''''''''
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingen kilder som angir at han var sogneprest i Østre Toten, heller ikke at han var bosatt i Biri<br/>
2 CONT Det er heller ingen kilder som angir at han var gift med Karen Eilertsdatter f. Schøller. Det var hans brors sønnesønn som også het [https://www.geni.com/people/Lauritz-Bastianson-Stabel
2 CONT ''''''(No sources stating that he was a parish priest in Østre Toten, nor that he was a resident of Biri
2 CONT There are also no sources to indicate that he was married to Karen Eilertsdatter f. Schøller. It was his brother's grandson who was also named Lauritz Bastiansen Stabel and was mayor of Trondheim, who was married to Karen Eilertsd
2 CONC atter f. Schøller.)''''''
2 CONT
2 CONT /6000000007334738244?through=6000000006853222238 Lauritz Bastiansen Stabel] og var borgermester i Trondheim, som var gift med Karen Eilertsdatter f. Schøller.<br/>
2 CONT Videre er det heller ingen kilder som angir at han var gift med en datter av Mons Evensen og Magnhild Dyresdatter på Store Re i Stange<br/>
2 CONT Siden det er usikkert om han var far til Eline Lauritzdatter, vet vi dermed ingenting om denne Lauritz Bastiansen Stabel
2 CONT '''''(/6000000007334738244?through=6000000006853222238 Lauritz Bastiansen Stabel] and was mayor of Trondheim, who was married to Karen Eilertsdatter f. Schøller.
2 CONT Furthermore, there are no sources to indicate that he was married to a daughter of Mons Evensen and Magnhild Dyresdatter at Store Re in Stange
2 CONT Since it is uncertain whether he was the father of Eline Lauritzdatter, we thus know nothing about this Lauritz Bastiansen Stabel)'''''
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Han bodde i Biri i Oppland i 1575?
2 CONT (He lived in Biri in Oppland in 1575?0
2 CONT
