1 OCCU Søster til Oluf Mortensen, sogneprest i Nes H. 1593-1608
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Anne Mortensdatter'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ''' Prestefrue i Vang Hedmark'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * f. ca 1594 i Nes, Ringsaker, foreldrene var presten Morten Olufsen og Birgitte
2 CONT * Anne giftet seg med presten  Haagen Mogensen Gyldenaar, de hadde barna Dorte Apelone, Mogens, Morten, Oluf og Marte 
2 CONT * 1604 Anne dør i Vang 
2 CONT
2 CONT Kilde:
2 CONT
2 CONT # http://old.genealogi.no/Prestehistorie/Biografier/Glad-Gyldenaar.htm#
2 CONT # https://forum.arkivverket.no/topic/129755-44290-morten-olufsen-sogneprest-p%C3%A5-nes-hedmark-1552-1593/
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Mortensdatter (b. 1564, d. 1604)
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Mortensdatter (daughter of Morten Olufsen) was born 1564 in Vang,Norway, and died 1604 in Vang,Norway. She married Haakon Mogensen Gyldenaar on 1589 in Vang,Hedmark,Norway, son of Mogens Haakonsen Alsen and Magnhild Dyresdatt
2 CONC er Hanestad.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Anne Mortensdatter and Haakon Mogensen Gyldenaar: Marriage: 1589, Vang,Hedmark,Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Anne Mortensdatter and Haakon Mogensen Gyldenaar are: Mogens Haakonsen Gyldenaar, b. 1589, Vang,Norway, d. 1630. +Marte Haakonsdatter Gyldenaar, b. 1591, Vang,Norway, d. 1652, Ringsaker,Hedmark,Norway. Morten Haakonsen
2 CONC  Gyldenaar, b. 1593, Vang,Norway, d. date unknown. Dorthe Haakonsdatter Gyldenaar, b. 1595, Vang,Norway, d. 1645. Apelone Haakonsdatter Gyldenaar, b. 1597, Vang,Norway, d. 1678, Lunde,Gausdal,Oppland,Norway. Oluf Haakonsen Gyldena
2 CONC ar, b. 1599, Vang,Norway, d. date unknown.
2 CONT
