2 CONT BIRTH: Abt 1550  He full name was taken from the IGI. MARRIAGE: IGI for SS. ORDINANCES: B & E from the temple card from the Jordan River Temple Family File. PROFESSIONAL RESEARCH:  Hedmark slekts historielage tidsskrift 1. Norsk T
2 CONC idsskrift for Genealogi 1,b.2,p. 265 2, p. 260  3, p. 243.  Research by: Mrs. Alfhild Gundersen Soren Jaabeksgt.8.7. Oslo 4. Norway. SUPPORTING FAMILY RECORDS: Family group sheet with dates stamped by temple workers plus added pap
2 CONC er with sealer, witness, and proxy names. In possession of: Barbara Christenson, Provo, Utah 84604. Verna's Book: 75
2 CONT === Mette is the daughter of Rasmus Hiorth ( ===
2 CONT Mette is the daughter of Rasmus Hiorth (Hjort), a Lutheran minister in southern Norway.
