2 CONC RSØN Mother: Anna Hansdatter WINCKE  Family 1 : Inger Mogensdatter GYLDENAAR  1.  NN ANTONIDATTER 2. +Mogens Antoniussen EIDE 3. +Karen ANTONIDATTER
