1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sigrid Hågensdtr. Nedre Løsnes, b. Approximately 1649 on Løsnes lower Fåvang, Ringebu, Oppland, d. Bjorge 1737 on the south, Fåvang, Ringebu, Oppland, buried 28-Apr-1737 in Ringebu, Oppland.
2 CONT
2 CONT The shift that Gunder-law Bjorge held with his wife Mali Haldordtr Sor Bjorge in 1737, indicated that the Sigrid Hågendtr who was still alive, owned two appearances in NORDRE Bjorge. In 1657 noted "Guldbrand Biörge bruger jbidem 1
2 CONC  skin Jtem Jndberger UDJ Ruderud sammestedtz 1 Schinder 1 fetling" - this may have been Sigrid's grandfather? It is of course also possible that it is sg about a typo. (Statthalderarkivet D IX. 31st Misc earth books from 1651 to 1
2 CONC 658. Ringebu1657).
2 CONT
